    "preamble": "In Re:- Madhusudan Dolai vs Re: An Application For Bail Under ... on 25 November, 2016 Author: Ashim Kumar Roy Bench: Ashim Kumar Roy 1 49 25.11.2016 C.R.M. No. 9920 of 2016 p.d. In re:- Madhusudan Dolai .... Petitioner.",
    "facts": "It is the case of the prosecution that by consuming poisonous I.D.liquor, two persons died. It appears that we granted bail to one of the co-accused, namely, Joydeb Bera on November 17, 2016 in connection with CRM No.9250 of 2016 essentially on the ground that no poison was detected in the viscera report.",
